{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04014.SBN#0001", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04014.SBN", "offset": 937, "capacity": 64, "raw_hex": "f5c2f16bf8e7f25ef374f0b2f1b2f1c781432f2ff3f0f1d8f9aef369f36df8b2f473f0eff0a5f29ef0a9f7d12f2ff0b9f0aef8baf0a98143f273f274f0af8148", "baseline_text": "쌍무를 움직이려면，//엄청난 영력이 필요하겠군…//에리카 군，괜찮아？", "kind": "ascr", "source": "双武を動かすには、//すさまじい霊力が必要だな……//エリカくん、大丈夫か？", "pointer_offset": 788, "unit": "dialogue:558c6254aff7658c", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04014.SBN#0002", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04014.SBN", "offset": 1010, "capacity": 56, "raw_hex": "f273f274f0aff0ef81b82f2ff14ef97bf45bf471f2b8f0a8f0f481432f2ff14ff9cef5e0f0b2f0a8f984f0c6f0f7f0a5f0b8f261f0ef81b8", "baseline_text": "괜찮아요∈//조금 괴롭더라도，//기분 탓이라고 생각하니까요∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "大丈夫ですよ！//ちょっとくらいツラくても、//気のせいだと思ってますから！", "pointer_offset": 792, "unit": "dialogue:d9a0ee5b4f482009", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04014.SBN#0003", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04014.SBN", "offset": 1083, "capacity": 32, "raw_hex": "f0f1f0cff144f7d1f25381432f2ffaccf484fc95f94af154f1c8f2c0f0ef8144", "baseline_text": "게다가…저，//꽤 힘낼 수 있거든요．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "それに……わたしって、//けっこうがんばれるんですよ。", "pointer_offset": 796, "unit": "dialogue:4878be3c75a04e7c", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04014.SBN#0004", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04014.SBN", "offset": 1136, "capacity": 34, "raw_hex": "f0a5f0a5f0a5f7d12f2ff0b9f0aef8baf0a9f0f32f2ff1bef1f7f0a5f168f0b18144", "baseline_text": "하하하…//에리카 군은//여전하구나．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "ははは……//エリカくんは//あいかわらずだな。", "pointer_offset": 800, "unit": "dialogue:b763d530d21d7254", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04014.SBN#0005", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04014.SBN", "offset": 1181, "capacity": 62, "raw_hex": "f253f957f0b5f0b5f144f8abf247f0e72f2ff2b0f984f154f0a2f0b8f261f0eff7d12f2ff0d8f143f1478143f484fc95f94af154f957f1c8f26bf0ef8144", "baseline_text": "저는 오오가미 씨를//믿고 있으니까요…//그래서，힘낼 수 있는 거예요．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "わたしは大神さんを//信じていますから……//だから、がんばれるんです。", "pointer_offset": 804, "unit": "dialogue:f8b725b190a2ac72", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04014.SBN#0006", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04014.SBN", "offset": 1250, "capacity": 62, "raw_hex": "f15afb6ff16ef0a8f0f48143f0b5f0b5f144f8abf247f1572f2ff253f8e7f0a4fc83fa85f1c8f0a8f184f7d12f2ff2b0f984f154f0a2f0b8f261f0ef8144", "baseline_text": "어떤 때라도，오오가미 씨는//저를 지켜 줄 거라고…//믿고 있으니까요．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "どんな時だって、大神さんは、//わたしを守ってくれるって……//信じていますから。", "pointer_offset": 808, "unit": "dialogue:e2c17cc92223c10b", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04014.SBN#0007", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04014.SBN", "offset": 2822, "capacity": 70, "raw_hex": "f0d8f0c7f0b8f261f7d1f0b5f0b5f144f8abf247f0f42f2ff2b0f95af1e2f1d5f0ef81442f2ff0b5f0b5f144f8abf247f957f0dff944f0a4fd80f1c8f0a8f957f2e1f0ef8144", "baseline_text": "그러니까…오오가미 씨도//믿어 주세요．//오오가미 씨는 제가 지킬 거라는 걸요．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "だから……大神さんも//信じてください。//大神さんはわたしが守るって。", "pointer_offset": 812, "unit": "dialogue:b0f3429649d133a8", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04014.SBN#0008", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04014.SBN", "offset": 1398, "capacity": 10, "raw_hex": "f0b9f0aef8baf0a9f7d1", "baseline_text": "에리카 군…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "エリカくん……", "pointer_offset": 816, "unit": "dialogue:b8383e8a3146e279", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04014.SBN#0009", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04014.SBN", "offset": 1413, "capacity": 16, "raw_hex": "f2c9f2e9f15af7d1f2b0f0c8f0f18144", "baseline_text": "알았어…믿을게．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "わかった……信じるよ。", "pointer_offset": 820, "unit": "dialogue:141891ab0a8bc9dc", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04014.SBN#0010", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04014.SBN", "offset": 1436, "capacity": 14, "raw_hex": "f14ef97bf156f191f0a5f0f08144", "baseline_text": "조금 불안하네．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "ちょっと不安だな。", "pointer_offset": 824, "unit": "dialogue:f1f9e415fd0da921", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04014.SBN#0011", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04014.SBN", "offset": 1455, "capacity": 38, "raw_hex": "f2c9f2e9f15af7d1f2b0f0c8f0f181442f2ff0b9f0aef8baf0a98143fa80f293f35cf14b8144", "baseline_text": "알았어…믿을게．//에리카 군，잘 부탁해．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "わかった……信じるよ。//エリカくん、よろしく頼む。", "pointer_offset": 828, "unit": "dialogue:f415c63f81cbaacd", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04014.SBN#0012", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04014.SBN", "offset": 1506, "capacity": 58, "raw_hex": "f0f0f7d1f2c9f29ef0cef0b8f0cf81442f2ff0b5f0b5f144f8abf247f8e1f263f277f7d12f2f8250824f824ff952f1d4f152f0b2f0b9f0ef8144", "baseline_text": "네…알겠습니다．//오오가미 씨의 말씀…//１００점 만점이에요．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "はい……わかりました。//大神さんの言葉……//１００点満点ですよ。", "pointer_offset": 832, "unit": "dialogue:d8dcbb21f4b9c97b", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04014.SBN#0013", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04014.SBN", "offset": 1571, "capacity": 40, "raw_hex": "f25c8143f144f4f6f0f32f2f8256824ff952f18ef0f4f9ccf16ef0f42f2ff154f0a4f1d4f0ef81b8", "baseline_text": "뭐，가끔은//７０점 정도일 때도//있지만요∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "まあ、時々//７０点ぐらいの時も//ありますけどね！", "pointer_offset": 836, "unit": "dialogue:6fa2d9301e3284ce", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04014.SBN#0014", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04014.SBN", "offset": 1620, "capacity": 42, "raw_hex": "f0a5f0a5f0a581442f2ff3f0f164f9a9f152f14af0f0f7d12f2ff199f999fa64f94bf2e6f0a8f1848144", "baseline_text": "하하하．//엄격한 점수네…//살살 좀 해 달라고．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "ははは。//きびしい点数だな……//手加減してくれよ。", "pointer_offset": 840, "unit": "dialogue:e2ab06585a2f9e44", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04014.SBN#0015", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04014.SBN", "offset": 2893, "capacity": 38, "raw_hex": "f16bfa89f263f277f8c8f0a5f0bcf957f1c8f26bf0ef81432f2ff0b5f0b5f144f8abf2478144", "baseline_text": "무슨 말씀을 하시는 거예요，//오오가미 씨．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "なに言ってるんですか、//大神さん。", "pointer_offset": 844, "unit": "dialogue:762dd29feaf4ae9d", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04014.SBN#0016", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04014.SBN", "offset": 1706, "capacity": 64, "raw_hex": "8252824ff952f18ef0f4f39ff8c8f16ef0f42f2ff154f1f3f0a2f0b8f261f0ef81432f2ff0b2f943f5b6f8f4faccf2cef0a5f8f1fa4ef1c8f0a8f184f0ef81b8", "baseline_text": "３０점 정도였을 때도//있었으니까요，//이래 봬도 꽤 후하게 준 거라고요∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "３０点ぐらいの時も//あったんですから、//これでも甘いぐらいですよ！", "pointer_offset": 848, "unit": "dialogue:4f98b6abe3e878e7", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04014.SBN#0017", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04014.SBN", "offset": 1773, "capacity": 24, "raw_hex": "f0a2f2b381ac2f2ff0d88143f0d8f2f0f955f1c8f0b88148", "baseline_text": "으앗〓//그，그랬던 거니？", "kind": "ascr", "source": "いいっ〓//そ、そうだったのかい？", "pointer_offset": 852, "unit": "dialogue:a37a46e1cd5cfcf3", "prior_review": "번역 검수"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04014.SBN#0018", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04014.SBN", "offset": 1806, "capacity": 28, "raw_hex": "f391f95af26cfa7cf16ef0f42f2ff1b7f2e9f0a2f0b8f261f0eff7d1", "baseline_text": "굳어 버릴 때도//많았으니까요…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "固まっちゃう時も//多かったですしね……", "pointer_offset": 856, "unit": "dialogue:906a89dc54076ae3", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04014.SBN#0019", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04014.SBN", "offset": 1845, "capacity": 40, "raw_hex": "f0a5f0a4f1d4f7d1f0d8fa62f0b5f0b5f144f8abf247f0e72f2ff253f957f1cff0aff14bf0ef8144", "baseline_text": "하지만…그런 오오가미 씨를//저는 좋아해요．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "でも……そんな大神さんが、//わたしは好きなんですよ。", "pointer_offset": 860, "unit": "dialogue:ae3f3f62d53fde52", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04014.SBN#0020", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04014.SBN", "offset": 1898, "capacity": 52, "raw_hex": "fa64f156f191f0a5f0f081442f2ff0b9f0aef8baf0a9f7d12f2ff5b5f563f1c8f0aef957f168f0a1f8b2f154f0a2f0b8f2618144", "baseline_text": "좀 불안하네．//에리카 군…//덜렁거리는 구석이 있으니까．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "ちょっと不安だな。//エリカくん……//ドジなところがあるし。", "pointer_offset": 864, "unit": "dialogue:d55c23880c69b828", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04014.SBN#0021", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04014.SBN", "offset": 1957, "capacity": 34, "raw_hex": "f25af16bf14b81b82f2ff0b5f0b5f144f8abf2478143f25af16bf14bf0ef816081b8", "baseline_text": "너무해∈//오오가미 씨，너무해요～∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "ひどいー！//大神さん、ひどいよ～∈", "pointer_offset": 868, "unit": "dialogue:170f3d402c6e7274", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04014.SBN#0022", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04014.SBN", "offset": 1992, "capacity": 80, "raw_hex": "f0b2f143f0f48143f0b5f0b5f144f8abf247f8e7f279f14bf1472f2ff1bef8c7f144f0a4f8a3f0c6f0f7f0ccf157f18df7d12f2ff0b5f0b5f144f8abf2478143f36cf1cdf1f8f0b2f0b9f0ef81608144", "baseline_text": "이래도，오오가미 씨를 위해서//여러 가지로 생각했는데…//오오가미 씨，심술쟁이에요～．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "これでも、大神さんのために//いろいろ考えてたのに……//大神さん、イジワルだよ～。", "pointer_offset": 872, "unit": "dialogue:34ca03806014fcc6", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04014.SBN#0023", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04014.SBN", "offset": 2932, "capacity": 52, "raw_hex": "f0ab8143f0abf191f14b8143f0b9f0aef8baf0a981442f2ff1dbf8b6f0b1fbb4f0e1f0abf8a3f0d8fa62f8f1f0aff0b8f0a8f7d1", "baseline_text": "미，미안해，에리카 군．//딱히 나쁜 의미로 그런 게 아니라…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "す、すまない、エリカくん。//別に悪い意味じゃ……", "pointer_offset": 876, "unit": "dialogue:6f211eea4a93d322", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04014.SBN#0024", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04014.SBN", "offset": 2122, "capacity": 30, "raw_hex": "f0b6f645f7d12f2ff0d8f2ca8143f2b0f95af1e2fa4df28af144f0ef8148", "baseline_text": "히윽…//그럼，믿어 주실 건가요？", "kind": "ascr", "source": "ひぐっ……//じゃあ、信じてくれますか？", "pointer_offset": 880, "unit": "dialogue:0b167a66b0d8089a", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04014.SBN#0025", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04014.SBN", "offset": 2161, "capacity": 24, "raw_hex": "f144f1e8f9a9f1a9f7d12f2ff158f36df94bf366f0f18144", "baseline_text": "가능한 한…//노력해 볼게．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "できるだけ……//努力してみるよ。", "pointer_offset": 884, "unit": "dialogue:f4c8b535cb21675c", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04014.SBN#0026", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04014.SBN", "offset": 2985, "capacity": 70, "raw_hex": "f0d8f27ef0cff1c7f7d1f273f274f0aff0ef81442f2ff253f8f4f0b5f0b5f144f8abf247f8e7f0a4fd80f94af154f0f4f38481432f2ff158f36dfa57f2aff0b8f261f0ef8144", "baseline_text": "그렇다면…괜찮아요．//저도 오오가미 씨를 지킬 수 있도록，//노력할 테니까요．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "なら……いいです。//わたしも大神さんを守れるよう、//努力しますから。", "pointer_offset": 888, "unit": "dialogue:9a57122b88f1a238", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04014.SBN#0027", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04014.SBN", "offset": 2263, "capacity": 50, "raw_hex": "f0a5f0a4f1d4f7d12f2ff0a4f167f8a4f281f0ccf8c8f16ef15781432f2ff3e9f0a2f99af1a0f147f94bf1e2f1d5f0ef8144", "baseline_text": "하지만…//지키지 못했을 때는，//웃으며 용서해 주세요．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "でも……//守れなかったときは、//笑って許してくださいね。", "pointer_offset": 892, "unit": "dialogue:9a79def32d35d5ca", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04014.SBN#0028", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04014.SBN", "offset": 2320, "capacity": 28, "raw_hex": "f0a5f0a5f0a5f7d12f2ff25c8143f0d8f96ef0c6f0f7f257f0f18144", "baseline_text": "하하하…//뭐，그때 생각할게．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "ははは……//まぁ、その時考えるよ。", "pointer_offset": 896, "unit": "dialogue:f93b3746356cb01e", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04014.SBN#0029", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04014.SBN", "offset": 2355, "capacity": 36, "raw_hex": "f253f14f8143f2b4f0bcf7d12f2ff2b0f95af1e2f8a4f287f0a2fa4df28af144f0ef8148", "baseline_text": "저기，역시…//믿어 주지 않으실 건가요？", "kind": "ascr", "source": "あの、やっぱり……//信じてもらえませんか？", "pointer_offset": 900, "unit": "dialogue:adb2af9d5bc35db6", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04014.SBN#0030", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04014.SBN", "offset": 2398, "capacity": 58, "raw_hex": "f2538143f174f0aef0b9f947f0b5f0b5f144f8abf247f1442f2ff0a4fc83f1e2f246f955f299f7d12f2ff393f8a4f287f984f154f15af0ef8144", "baseline_text": "저，파리에서 오오가미 씨가//지켜 주셨던 것…//잊지 않고 있어요．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "わたし、巴里で大神さんに//守ってもらったこと……//忘れていませんよ。", "pointer_offset": 904, "unit": "dialogue:efc9623b67829e74", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04014.SBN#0031", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04014.SBN", "offset": 2467, "capacity": 54, "raw_hex": "f0d8f143f147f7d1f0b5f0b5f144f8abf247f0b9f0f12f2ff0f3f783f8e7f4fbf0aff948f1a9f0cff1842f2ff0c6f0f7f14bf147f7d1", "baseline_text": "그래서…오오가미 씨에게//은혜를 갚아야 한다고//생각해서…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "だから……大神さんに//恩返しをしないと、//いけないと思って……", "pointer_offset": 908, "unit": "dialogue:beecf68d00265225", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04014.SBN#0032", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04014.SBN", "offset": 2530, "capacity": 28, "raw_hex": "f174f0aef0b9f947f1b7f0b281432f2ff144f1d0f14cf15af0eff7d1", "baseline_text": "파리에서 많이，//가져왔어요…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "巴里からたくさん、//持ってきたんです……", "pointer_offset": 912, "unit": "dialogue:80cbaeac93c60614", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04014.SBN#0033", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04014.SBN", "offset": 2571, "capacity": 14, "raw_hex": "f16b8143f16bf2c5f0c8f7d18148", "baseline_text": "무，무엇을…？", "kind": "ascr", "source": "な、なにをだい……", "pointer_offset": 916, "unit": "dialogue:22ca4e41b70d609a", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04014.SBN#0034", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04014.SBN", "offset": 3056, "capacity": 58, "raw_hex": "f1b1f1e78143f0f3f783f25281442f2ff0b1fbdef358f8a8fa60f28af18d81432f2ff3f0f1d8f9aef345f8b2f243f95af26cf35df0f0f0ef8144", "baseline_text": "물론，은혜죠．//나름 골라 온 건데，//엄청난 양이 되어 버렸네요．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "もちろん、恩ですよ。//選んだつもりなんですけど、//すごい量になっちゃいましたね。", "pointer_offset": 920, "unit": "dialogue:60b4d277e3e49533", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04014.SBN#0035", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04014.SBN", "offset": 2671, "capacity": 48, "raw_hex": "f253f0e7f7d12f2ff2b0f8a4f287f0a2f346f8f4f243f0b8f2612f2ff0b2f299f1d4f8f3f0f2f8aff1e2f1d5f0ef8144", "baseline_text": "저를…//믿지 않으셔도 되니까//이것만은 받아 주세요．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "わたしのこと……//信じてくれなくてもいいですから//これだけはもらってくださいね。", "pointer_offset": 924, "unit": "dialogue:d587b439092cfe84", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04014.SBN#0036", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04014.SBN", "offset": 2752, "capacity": 42, "raw_hex": "f0af8143f0aff0aff7d12f2ffa80f271f272f29ef0a4f1d481432f2ff0e9f0a6f8b6f0f2f0c8f0f1f7d1", "baseline_text": "아，아아…//잘 모르겠지만，//감사히 받을게…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "あ、あぁ……//よくわからないけど、//ありがたくもらっておくよ……", "pointer_offset": 928, "unit": "dialogue:40facfe92b5278a9", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
